  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the European Parliament&apos;s Election Observation Mission to Lebanon 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As per EU EOM Lebanon 2022 ToR, the European Parliament and the Service Provider (IOM) could conclude a contract to implement the logistic, security and administrative aspects of the European Parliament Election Observation Delegation (EP EOD), where applicable under similar conditions as the ones provided to the EU EOM.</narrative>
